  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>달의&nbsp;뜨고&nbsp;지는&nbsp;시간,&nbsp;행성의&nbsp;관측&nbsp;가능&nbsp;시간에&nbsp;대해&nbsp;설명할 때,&nbsp;<br>포스트잇에&nbsp;인쇄해서&nbsp;나눠주면&nbsp;<br>공부할 때 접어서 사용하고 다시 펴서 학습지에 붙여두면 좋을 것 같아&nbsp;만들었어요.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">1.&nbsp;A4지에&nbsp;포스트잇&nbsp;크기로&nbsp;표를&nbsp;만들고,&nbsp;그&nbsp;위에&nbsp;포스트잇&nbsp;붙이고,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;복사기에&nbsp;종이&nbsp;들어가는&nbsp;방향을&nbsp;고려해서&nbsp;넣은&nbsp;후&nbsp;인쇄&nbsp;^^<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; 한&nbsp;장씩&nbsp;나눠주고,&nbsp;자르고&nbsp;접으면&nbsp;완성...<br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2369DE4F575EC99A39\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"253\" height=\"272\" style=\"width: 253px; height: 272px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"P20160613_113429459_94262A33-12FB-4C99-A3AB-FAE2A2A66525.jpg\"  id=\"A_2369DE4F575EC99A3975B2\"/>&nbsp;&nbsp; <img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/210EE74F575EC99B18\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"273\" height=\"172\" style=\"width: 273px; height: 172px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"P20160613_113440534_88177B10-625A-4A6F-A18D-5BF612D83AB4.jpg\"  id=\"A_210EE74F575EC99B18C1F0\"/><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2777C048575F5E4D34\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"245\" height=\"247\" style=\"width: 245px; height: 247px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"918\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"P20160614_102524903_77020D8D-F25A-4220-A3A7-22D3FD170321.jpg\"  id=\"A_2777C048575F5E4D34474C\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/211A234F575EC99C0D\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"268\" height=\"361\" style=\"width: 268px; height: 361px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1000\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"P20160613_113228546_C6FCF182-C1DD-49AB-8C71-D8FF610E3AC6.jpg\"  id=\"A_211A234F575EC99C0D40BE\"/>&nbsp;&nbsp; </p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">2.&nbsp;뒷면에&nbsp;자석&nbsp;붙여서&nbsp;칠판에&nbsp;사용하는&nbsp;지평선&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2507A54F575EC99E20\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"355\" height=\"169\" style=\"width: 355px; height: 169px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"P20160613_113528719_CC45D117-2174-4DF9-A043-1F49FC732C54.jpg\"  id=\"A_2507A54F575EC99E20E0C1\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/267DFA4F575EC99F25\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"354\" height=\"211\" style=\"width: 354px; height: 211px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"P20160613_113535224_90C061EC-F204-4412-AA49-D36AD0CC64A7.jpg\"  id=\"A_267DFA4F575EC99F259328\"/></p><p><br></p><br><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
